[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item_data")
item_name = "Research Map"
item_description = "A forest map with three marked locations. The nests must be documented."
item_type = 1
note_text = "[img]res://assets/Textures/forest_map.png[/img]

Three Hasselmus nests have been identified in the surrounding forest. Each nest must be documented to track the creature's territory.

Nest locations marked on the map:
- Nest Alpha: Deep in the eastern woods
- Nest Beta: Near the northern ridge
- Nest Gamma: Hidden in the western hollow

Document all three nests to complete the research."
scene_to_spawn = ExtResource("2_note_scene")
